      <keyword>DART</keyword>
      <description>This data collection contains a set of digital
         terrain maps and ancillary information (slope, magnitude of gravity, etc) for
         didymos_model_v003. It is the final model of Didymos produced by the DART project using
         both LICIACube and DART images. It has an accuracy uncertainty of ~14 m in x, y, and z,
         with ~ 3.3% volume uncertainty. See SIS for details on ancillary information
         provided.
      </description>
